    "turn_text": "sure. So as you know, Andrew is I've been talking about this a lot, Andrew Yang. He said that, how can we get our government in the 21st century? I live in Los Angeles, so I am in the same state you are. But the thing is, is that why is our government? so behind the curve when it comes to technology and you as a congressman who represents that part of silicon valley what can we do to get silicon valley and washington the sea to talk to each other about all these technological disruptions and what they're doing about you know the employment opportunities we have and the kind of So technology can lift everyone up rather than just being looked at this thing that's like, oh it's going to get rid of jobs. I think that's important.",
