  {
    "episode_id": 84135,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/4/84135.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 47,
    "turn_text": "I guess I'll pick that up. In addition to getting these opportunities for jobs into rural and minority communities that are generally underserved, how do we get more meaningful services like banking to rural areas that don't have cash flow that meets what a bank would say is profitable enough to set up a branch there.",
