        "text": "Access to basic financial services like banking is essential for community development.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Profitability criteria used by banks are insufficient indicators of community need.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "There is a gap between current banking infrastructure and actual community needs in rural areas.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker sees themselves as having agency in addressing systemic inequities in service provision.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
