        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "Social change begins with shifting public perception and collective agreement on values.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "Public discourse can be influenced through advocacy and discussion.",
        "confidence": 0.86
      },
      {
        "text": "The American Scorecard represents a credible and actionable model for systemic reform.",
        "confidence": 0.85
