      {
        "text": "Alternative metrics to GDP will lead to more equitable and humane outcomes.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "The capabilities framework has sufficient empirical and moral grounding to inform large-scale institutional reform.",
        "confidence": 0.86
