    "turn_text": "Okay, I'll be quick. Congressman Kana, my question is about vote by mail. I am representing a coalition among multiple organizations in New York State right now to campaign for vote by mail. So my question is this, how are you in California combat fighting the Republican missing information campaign? the governor used some sign the executive order, which the Republican Party filed a lawsuit for. So specifically, what tactics have you been, has been used against both by mail? And what are you doing to fight back? And what has been the most effective tactic in fighting back?",
