    "turn_idx": 124,
    "turn_text": "Well, it's a great question. I mean, California, we know that vote by mail works. We know that it leads to far, far more people voting, more minorities voting. It makes it much more possible for non incumbents to run. And we have to just combat the falsity. I mean, right now, there's just falsity that it's somehow fraudulent. If anything is less fraudulent, The safe, it's a very transparent process. It allows increased participation. And so I think we just have to continue to get the facts out. The president has an incentive not to have everyone turn out. I mean, it's obvious that he doesn't want the large minority turnout, large young person turnout, large women turn out. That's how he loses. And he knows he can't win if there's a large turnout. So he wants to minimize turnout, and that's why he's trying to reduce the the vote and we need to push back. I just have been in touch with Andrew quite regularly. I think it's very important, but particularly at this time where we've seen some of the Asian American China bashing that, in addition to everything else that Andrew have a voice, I think he needs to be part of Biden's cabinet. I think we need to push to have him in a very strong leadership role in a future administration. And I'm committed to working with him. Because I believe in a 21st century that cooperates more than confronts that looks to build our relationships with other nations to move towards more just multi racial multi ethnic democracy. So I appreciate all your passion. What you achieved was remarkable, no one you're wondering was in this country now, probably most of the country does, and many of his ideas, of course, are directly influencing the people, the emergency for people's act that Tim Ryan and I did. So appreciate your passion. Hope you'll continue to engage in social media and on my Twitter account on Facebook on Tim's account on Andrews account that really helps to push ideas you agree with or push back if you disagree with something but just the engagement really makes a big difference so appreciate your activism and appreciate your sharing this form with me.",
